{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40076","headline":"和仆射二十四丈牡丹八韵 · 徐夤","name":"和仆射二十四丈牡丹八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝王城里看，无故亦无新。\n忍摘都缘借，移栽未有因。\n光阴嫌太促，开落一何频。\n羞杀登墙女，饶将解佩人。\n蘂堪灵凤啄，香许白龙亲。\n素练笼霞晓，红妆带脸春。\n莫辞终夕醉，易老少年身。\n买取归天上，宁教逐世尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}